  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A simple, convenient spot at the Résidence Palazzo Del Mar, on the Promenade de la Mer in Cavalaire, for a sandwich or a quick meal without breaking the bank. French cuisine, a terrace, and a setting confirmed by an active Tripadvisor listing (3.4/5) and a professional Facebook page (lagrignoterie83).</p>
      <p>Useful clarification: contrary to what our previous listing stated, this address is on the town-centre seafront/promenade, about a 20-minute walk from the Cavalaire marina — not literally "facing the harbour".</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Expect to pay between €16 and €20 for a meal, an affordable budget that works well for a quick weekday lunch or after the beach. Regarding dogs: a general tourism site for the region (Côte d'Azur France / Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur Tourisme) describes the establishment as pet friendly, but we found no explicit customer review confirming this welcome on the terrace or indoors, nor any mention of a water bowl being offered. To be safe, consider this information likely but not guaranteed, and confirm directly on-site or by phone (04 94 64 34 28) before settling in with your dog.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: this is a handy spot for a quick lunch, but call ahead if your dog's welcome is an important factor for your visit — the information isn't 100% guaranteed.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Cavalaire seafront and promenade are right nearby, good for a quiet digestive walk before continuing on to the harbour, about twenty minutes away on foot — a good chance to continue on to the <a href="/en/fiche-sentier-littoral">coastal path</a> or the <a href="/en/fiche-bonporteau">Bonporteau beach</a>. If you need it while you're there, the <a href="/en/fiche-veterinaire-tison">Tison veterinary clinic</a> is also in Cavalaire-sur-Mer.</p>
